{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1511298-homebrew-new-endowment-\u2014-pactio-feedback-wanted","id":1511298,"title":"[Homebrew] New Endowment \u2014 Pactio (Feedback wanted)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-10T16:45:34-07:00","id":1511298,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> [Homebrew] New Endowment \u2014 Pactio (Feedback wanted)","content":"I'm getting around to fleshing out a Hunter Conspiracy I made back in the 1e days inspired loosely by Princess. It's a Changeling focused Conspiracy, with a theme of being magical girls. They gain Endowments based much more heavily in Changeling 1e's Pledge system, where you could grant Merits. Mechanically the Hunters of this Conspiracy make bargains with the Seelie Faeries (their catch-all term for Changelings and Goblins that are benign or beneficial). They take on an Addiction to performing some sort of task and in exchange they get access to supernatural abilities.<br /> <br /> I'm looking to make this good enough to put up on the Storyteller's Vault. <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1k2PJhhcpjJTQxTkZBVCDcPJWGep6MCsI2e5_H07jjv4/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Here's that chapter</a>. Let me know what you think. I could even go through and give my math on the Endowment Building, if anyone is interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-17T16:16:26-07:00","id":1511935,"title":"","content":"I say it looks like it's ready to go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-18T09:18:23-07:00","id":1512020,"title":"","content":"If your interested in adding a twist to a magical girl classic. You could say that they construct an alternative identity via code names and elaborate frilly costumes. Then they sign the pledge with that identity's name meaning the benefits and the drawbacks only apply while in costume.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-22T08:39:22-07:00","id":1512358,"title":"","content":"I. LOVE. THIS. SO. MUCH. The idea of taking the magical girl archetype &amp; turning that into a monster hunter is something I didn\u2019t know I needed until now. My favorite endowments in this set are Hammer Space &amp; Knock/Lock. I\u2019ve been trying to figure out how to give my players the genre blended/splat mixed powers I\u2019ve promised them w/o knowing how to best go about it so I\u2019m definitely taking inspo from this amazing thing you\u2019ve done here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27935-trynmybest","name":"trynmybest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27935_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-25T16:18:51-07:00","id":1512791,"title":"","content":"Whoops, I expected email notifications. I didn't realize people had replied to me. Either way, <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">I published it</a>.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider